# Allowed direct dependencies of every Cargo manifest in this repository.
#
# scripts/check-deps.sh compares this list with `cargo metadata` for the
# workspace and for extension/, and fails on any difference in either
# direction. Any edit to this file, including adding a crate, needs the
# maintainer's sign-off in the pull request.
#
# One entry per line: <manifest directory> <kind> <package name>
#   kind: normal, dev or build (a target-specific dependency counts under its
#   kind); package name: the crate's name on crates.io or its path package,
#   not a `package = ...` rename.

crates/xcode-dap normal anyhow
crates/xcode-dap normal clap
crates/xcode-dap normal flate2
crates/xcode-dap normal libc
crates/xcode-dap normal log
crates/xcode-dap normal serde
crates/xcode-dap normal serde_json
crates/xcode-dap normal tokio
crates/xcode-dap normal tokio-util
crates/xcode-dap normal xcode-dap-config

crates/xcode-dap-config normal serde

extension normal serde_json
extension normal xcode-dap-config
extension normal zed_extension_api
